<title>GERMANY: Kali+Salz 96 net profit at 21 mln dmk.</title>
<headline>Kali+Salz 96 net profit at 21 mln dmk.</headline>
<dateline>KASSEL, Germany 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Business year 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   21	vs 16</p>
<p>    Group balance sheet			65 loss vs n/a</p>
<p>    Group sales				  74	vs 87</p>
<p>    Group fixed asset investments	  11	vs 9</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of German potash fertiliser group is Kali und Salz Beteiligungs AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
